  "reading": "The anchors' own bend, continued below them, fits the new rungs better than the straight line in Llama-3.1-8B (0.1547 against 0.1646 mean absolute log error); and the line fits better in Qwen3-14B, OLMo-2-32B (0.1529 against 0.2508; 0.1186 against 0.2195). The two extrapolations bracket the measurement in every member, so a shortfall against the line is not by itself evidence of a floor; but the bend is only the better description where it is listed, and where the line wins the curvature alternative does not offset the pre-registered reading."
